OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies after collision
OL,4,Awith delivery van
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died following a
OL,7,Fcollision involving a motorbike and a
OL,8,Fsupermarket delivery van in
OL,9,FStoke-on-Trent.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,FDeakin Road, at the junction with Chell
OL,13,FHeath Road, at about 4.45 GMT on
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FThe man, in his 40s, who was riding an
OL,17,Forange Kawasaki motorbike, suffered
OL,18,Fserious injuries and was pronounced
OL,19,Fdead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
